CHAPTER.VERS:
Then he cried in my ears with a loud voice, saying, Cause

          {+}
         those who have charge over the city to draw near, every man with his destroying weapon in his hand.

And to the others he said in my hearing, Go

          {+}
         through the city after him, and strike: don't let your

          {+}
         eye spare, neither have

          {+}
         pity;

And he said to them, Defile the house, and fill the courts with the slain: go

          {+}
         forth. And they went forth, and struck in the city.
